stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DECLARED
    DECLARED --> CAPTURING: intent frozen
    CAPTURING --> REPRODUCIBLE: identity + environment + outputs match
    CAPTURING --> BLOCKED_SOURCE: source commit mismatch
    CAPTURING --> BLOCKED_INPUT: input digest mismatch
    CAPTURING --> BLOCKED_ENV: toolchain or lock mismatch
    CAPTURING --> BLOCKED_OUTPUT: output missing / not ready
    BLOCKED_SOURCE --> DECLARED: create new intent or rerun
    BLOCKED_INPUT --> DECLARED: recapture approved input
    BLOCKED_ENV --> CAPTURING: rebuild declared environment
    BLOCKED_OUTPUT --> CAPTURING: regenerate evidence
    REPRODUCIBLE --> [*]
